    "body": "> @zzamboni colors work, but i'm getting a lot of `%{%}` characters (some unicode problem?).\r\n> I assume this just needs some starship config, but i can't figure it out at the moment.\r\n> \r\n> ```\r\n> %{%}projects/github/rsteube%{%} via %{%} %{%}%{%}v1.15%{%} %{%}❯%{%}\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nTry unsetting the `STARSHIP_SHELL` environment variable. These extra characters are added to keep the shell from interpreting them on bash and zsh.",
